<template>
<div class="co-app">
 <header class="co-header"><div><small>NEUROSOFT · CONTABILIDAD</small><h1>Control contable de la empresa</h1><p>Operaciones, libros y estados financieros con trazabilidad.</p></div><b-button v-if="context.superadmin" variant="outline-light" @click="modal='company'">Nueva empresa</b-button></header>
 <b-alert :show="!!error" variant="danger" dismissible @dismissed="error=''">{{ error }}</b-alert><b-alert :show="!!success" variant="success" dismissible @dismissed="success=''">{{ success }}</b-alert>
 <div class="co-filters"><label>Empresa<b-form-select v-model="companyId" :options="companyOptions" :disabled="busy" @change="switchCompany"/></label><label>Desde<b-form-input type="date" v-model="filters.from"/></label><label>Hasta<b-form-input type="date" v-model="filters.to"/></label><label>Sucursal<b-form-select v-model="filters.branchId" :options="branchOptions"/></label><b-button variant="primary" :disabled="busy||!companyId" @click="load">Consultar</b-button></div>
 <div v-if="!companyId" class="co-empty">Selecciona una empresa. Superadmin puede crearla y asignar al contador desde Configuración.</div>
 <template v-else>
 <nav class="co-nav"><button v-for="item in tabs" :key="item.id" :class="{active:tab===item.id}" @click="tab=item.id;load()">{{ item.name }}</button></nav>
 <section v-if="tab==='dashboard'&&dashboard" class="co-section">
  <div class="co-kpis"><article v-for="k in kpis" :key="k.label"><small>{{ k.label }}</small><strong>S/ {{ money(k.value) }}</strong></article></div>
  <div class="co-grid"><article><h3>Revisión y cierre</h3><p v-for="p in dashboard.pending" :key="p.Status">{{ statusLabel(p.Status) }}: <b>{{ p.Count }}</b></p><p v-for="p in dashboard.pendingSources" :key="p.State">Origen {{ statusLabel(p.State) }}: <b>{{ p.Count }}</b></p><b-alert :show="dashboard.unbalanced.length>0" variant="danger">Hay asientos descuadrados. No se permite su contabilización.</b-alert><p>Los saldos proceden de asientos contabilizados. Los borradores no afectan los resultados.</p></article><article><h3>Períodos recientes</h3><div v-for="p in dashboard.periods.slice(0,8)" :key="p.Period">{{ p.Period }} <b-badge :variant="p.State==='closed'?'secondary':'success'">{{ p.State==='closed'?'Cerrado':'Abierto' }}</b-badge></div></article></div>
 </section>
 <section v-if="tab==='accounts'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Plan de cuentas</h2><template v-if="can('manage')"><b-button @click="editAccount()">Nueva cuenta</b-button><b-button @click="write('starterCatalog',{})">Cargar catálogo base PCGE</b-button><label class="co-upload">Importar CSV<input type="file" accept=".csv" @change="upload($event,'accounts')"/></label></template><b-form-input v-model="query" @input="accountPage=1" placeholder="Buscar código o nombre"/></div><p>Catálogo base con cuentas operativas; puedes importar el PCGE completo y tus subcuentas. Las cuentas agrupadoras no reciben asientos.</p><b-table small responsive :items="filteredAccounts" :fields="accountFields" :per-page="50" :current-page="accountPage"><template slot="Postable" slot-scope="r">{{ Number(r.item.Postable)?'Movimiento':'Agrupadora' }}</template><template slot="Active" slot-scope="r">{{ Number(r.item.Active)?'Activa':'Inactiva' }}</template><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button v-if="can('manage')" size="sm" @click="editAccount(r.item)">Editar</b-button></template></b-table><b-pagination v-model="accountPage" :total-rows="filteredAccounts.length" :per-page="50"/></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='entries'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Asientos contables</h2><b-button v-if="can('draft')" variant="primary" @click="newDraft">Nuevo asiento</b-button><b-button v-if="can('draft')" @click="modal='template'">Registrar operación</b-button><b-form-select v-model="entryStatus" :options="statusOptions" @change="load"/></div><b-table small responsive :items="entries" :fields="entryFields" :per-page="50" :current-page="entryPage"><template slot="Status" slot-scope="r"><b-badge>{{ statusLabel(r.item.Status) }}</b-badge></template><template slot="Debit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Debit) }}</template><template slot="Credit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Credit) }}</template><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button size="sm" @click="openEntry(r.item.Id)">Ver / revisar</b-button></template></b-table><b-pagination v-model="entryPage" :total-rows="entries.length" :per-page="50"/><p v-if="entries.length===1000">Se muestran 1000 asientos. Reduce el rango para consultar el resto.</p></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='sources'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Operaciones del ERP</h2><b-button v-if="can('draft')" variant="primary" :disabled="busy" @click="write('capture',filters)">Leer ventas, compras y caja</b-button></div><p>Lee los almacenes asignados a esta empresa. No modifica ventas, compras ni inventario. Caja se lee solo desde cuentas ERP vinculadas; Yape informativo queda neutral. Los datos requieren revisión antes de generar el borrador.</p><b-table small responsive :items="sources" :fields="sourceFields" :per-page="50" :current-page="sourcePage"><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button v-if="can('review')&&r.item.State==='pending'" size="sm" @click="reviewSource(r.item)">Revisar origen</b-button><b-button v-if="can('review')&&r.item.State==='pending'" size="sm" @click="linkManualSource(r.item)">Vincular manual</b-button><b-button v-if="r.item.EntryId" size="sm" @click="openEntry(r.item.EntryId)">Ver asiento</b-button><b-button v-if="can('review') &amp;&amp; ['conflict','generated'].includes(r.item.State)" size="sm" @click="resolveSource(r.item)">Resolver conflicto</b-button></template></b-table><b-pagination v-model="sourcePage" :total-rows="sources.length" :per-page="50"/><p v-if="sources.length===1000">Se muestran 1000 or?genes. Reduce el rango de fechas.</p></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='reports'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Libros y estados financieros</h2><b-form-select v-model="report" :options="reportOptions" @change="load"/><b-form-select v-if="['journal','ledger','trial','cash','auxiliary'].includes(report)" v-model="reportAccount" :options="[{value:'',text:'Todas las cuentas'},...accountOptions]" @change="load"/><b-button v-if="can('export')" @click="exportReport('xlsx')">Excel</b-button><b-button v-if="can('export')" @click="exportReport('pdf')">PDF</b-button><b-button v-if="can('export')" @click="exportReport('csv')">CSV</b-button></div><template v-if="report==='statements'&&statement"><div class="co-grid"><article><h3>Situación financiera</h3><p>Activos: S/ {{ money(statement.position.assets) }}</p><p>Pasivos: S/ {{ money(statement.position.liabilities) }}</p><p>Patrimonio registrado: S/ {{ money(statement.position.equity) }}</p><p>Resultado no cerrado: S/ {{ money(statement.position.unclosedResult) }}</p><b-alert :show="statement.position.difference!==0" variant="danger">Diferencia: {{ money(statement.position.difference) }}</b-alert></article><article><h3>Resultado del período</h3><p>Ingresos: {{ money(statement.results.income) }}</p><p>Gastos/costos: {{ money(statement.results.expenses) }}</p><strong>Resultado neto: S/ {{ money(statement.results.net) }}</strong></article><article><h3>Flujos de efectivo · Método directo</h3><p>Saldo inicial: {{ money(statement.cashFlow.opening) }}</p><p v-for="(value,key) in statement.cashFlow.flows" :key="key">{{ flowLabel(key) }}: {{ money(value) }}</p><p>Saldo final: {{ money(statement.cashFlow.closing) }}</p></article><article><h3>Cambios en el patrimonio</h3><p>Inicial: {{ money(statement.equity.opening) }}</p><p>Movimientos patrimoniales: {{ money(statement.equity.capitalMovements) }}</p><p>Resultado: {{ money(statement.equity.periodResult) }}</p><p>Final: {{ money(statement.equity.closing) }}</p></article></div></template><b-table v-else small responsive :items="reportRows" :fields="reportFields" :per-page="100" :current-page="reportPage"><template slot="Debit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Debit) }}</template><template slot="Credit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Credit) }}</template><template slot="Balance" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Balance) }}</template><template slot="OpeningDebit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.OpeningDebit) }}</template><template slot="OpeningCredit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.OpeningCredit) }}</template><template slot="RunningBalance" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.RunningBalance) }}</template><template slot="Total" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Total) }}</template><template slot="Igv" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Igv) }}</template></b-table><b-pagination v-if="report!=='statements'" v-model="reportPage" :total-rows="reportRows.length" :per-page="100"/></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='tax'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Impuestos y conciliación SIRE / PLE</h2><label>Período<b-form-input type="month" v-model="period"/></label><b-button @click="loadTaxReconciliation">Conciliar</b-button><label v-if="can('reconcile')" class="co-upload">Importar propuesta normalizada<input type="file" accept=".csv" @change="upload($event,'tax')"/></label><b-form-select v-model="taxKind" :options="[{value:'sale',text:'Ventas'},{value:'purchase',text:'Compras'}]"/><b-button v-if="can('export')&&company.Obligation==='ple'" @click="exportReport('ple')">PLE · Diario</b-button></div><div v-if="tax" class="co-kpis"><article><small>IGV débito fiscal</small><strong>{{ money(tax.summary.debitIgv) }}</strong></article><article><small>Crédito fiscal revisado</small><strong>{{ money(tax.summary.creditIgv) }}</strong></article><article><small>Diferencia antes de saldos a favor</small><strong>{{ money(tax.summary.netIgvBeforeCarry) }}</strong></article></div><p v-if="tax">{{ tax.note }}</p><p>Obligación: <b>{{ company.Obligation }}</b>. Régimen: <b>{{ company.Regime }}</b>. Las retenciones, percepciones y detracciones se registran por documento; no se presumen iguales para todas las empresas.</p><b-table small responsive :items="taxMatches" :fields="['key','localTotal','externalTotal','state']"><template slot="localTotal" slot-scope="r">{{ r.item.localTotal===null?'Sin documento':money(r.item.localTotal) }}</template><template slot="externalTotal" slot-scope="r">{{ r.item.externalTotal===null?'Sin propuesta':money(r.item.externalTotal) }}</template></b-table><div class="co-links"><router-link to="/reportes/ReporteSireVentas">Abrir SIRE de ventas existente</router-link><router-link to="/reportes/ReporteSireMovimiento">Abrir SIRE de compras existente</router-link></div><p>La exportación no presenta declaraciones. Revisa la propuesta y valida el archivo en los validadores oficiales antes de enviarlo.</p></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='banks'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Caja, bancos y conciliación</h2><b-form-select v-model="bankId" :options="bankOptions" @change="loadBank"/><b-button v-if="can('manage')" @click="modal='bank'">Nueva cuenta</b-button><label v-if="can('reconcile')" class="co-upload">Importar extracto CSV<input type="file" accept=".csv" @change="upload($event,'bank')"/></label></div><p>CSV: id,date,memo,amount. Importe positivo para abono y negativo para cargo; moneda de la cuenta. No modifica movimientos operativos del ERP.</p><template v-if="reconciliation"><div class="co-kpis"><article><small>Movimiento extracto</small><strong>{{ money(reconciliation.periodStatementMovement) }}</strong></article><article><small>Movimiento contable</small><strong>{{ money(reconciliation.periodBookMovement) }}</strong></article><article><small>Diferencia</small><strong>{{ money(reconciliation.difference) }}</strong></article></div><p>{{ reconciliation.note }}</p><div v-if="can('reconcile')" class="co-form-grid"><label>Saldo inicial del extracto<b-form-input v-model="statementInput.opening"/></label><label>Saldo final del extracto<b-form-input v-model="statementInput.closing"/></label><label>Referencia / n?mero de extracto<b-form-input v-model="statementInput.reference"/></label><b-button @click="saveStatement">Guardar saldos del extracto</b-button></div><p v-if="reconciliation.statement">Saldo contable final: {{ money(reconciliation.bookClosing) }} ? Diferencia de saldo: {{ money(reconciliation.closingDifference) }} ? Diferencia del extracto: {{ money(reconciliation.statementArithmeticDifference) }}</p><div class="co-grid"><article><h3>Extracto</h3><b-table small responsive :items="reconciliation.items" :fields="bankItemFields"><template slot="Amount" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Amount) }}</template><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button v-if="can('reconcile')&&Number(r.item.RemainingAmount)!==0" size="sm" @click="matching=r.item">Asociar</b-button><b-button v-if="can('reconcile')&&r.item.LineId" size="sm" @click="unmatch(r.item)">Deshacer</b-button></template></b-table></article><article><h3>Libro contable</h3><b-table small responsive :items="reconciliation.ledger" :fields="bankLedgerFields"><template slot="OriginalDebit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.OriginalDebit) }}</template><template slot="OriginalCredit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.OriginalCredit) }}</template><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button v-if="matching&&Number(r.item.RemainingAmount)!==0" size="sm" @click="write('match',{bankItemId:matching.Id,lineId:r.item.Id})">Conciliar con {{ matching.ExternalId }}</b-button></template></b-table></article></div></template></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='assets'" class="co-section"><div class="co-toolbar"><h2>Activos y depreciación</h2><b-button v-if="can('draft')" @click="modal='asset'">Registrar activo</b-button><label>Período<b-form-input type="month" v-model="period"/></label></div><p>Depreciación lineal contable mensual desde el mes de inicio; vida útil y valor residual definidos por la empresa. No se presume depreciación tributaria.</p><b-table small responsive :items="assets" :fields="assetFields"><template slot="Cost" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Cost) }}</template><template slot="Residual" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Residual) }}</template><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button v-if="can('draft')" size="sm" @click="write('depreciation',{assetId:r.item.Id,period})">Generar borrador mensual</b-button></template></b-table></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='config'" class="co-section"><h2>Configuración y permisos</h2><div class="co-grid"><article><h3>Períodos</h3><div class="co-inline"><b-form-input type="month" v-model="period"/><b-button v-if="can('period')" @click="write('period',{period})">Abrir período</b-button></div><b-table small :items="periods" :fields="['Period','State','actions']"><template slot="actions" slot-scope="r"><b-button v-if="can('period') &amp;&amp; (r.item.State!=='closed'||can('manage'))" size="sm" @click="periodAction(r.item)">{{ r.item.State==='closed'?'Reabrir':'Cerrar' }}</b-button></template></b-table></article><article><h3>Usuarios</h3><b-form-input v-model="member.username" placeholder="Usuario del ERP"/><b-form-select v-model="member.role" :options="roles"/><b-button v-if="can('manage')" @click="write('member',member)">Asignar rol</b-button><b-table small :items="members" :fields="['Username','Role']"/></article><article><h3>Sucursales y origen ERP</h3><b-form-input v-model="branch.name" placeholder="Nombre de sucursal"/><b-form-input type="number" v-model.number="branch.warehouseId" placeholder="ID del almacén ERP"/><b-button v-if="can('manage')" @click="write('branch',branch)">Agregar sucursal</b-button><b-table small :items="branches" :fields="['Name','WarehouseId']"/></article><article><h3>Cuentas predeterminadas</h3><div v-for="item in mappingFields" :key="item.key"><label>{{ item.label }}<b-form-select v-model="settings.accounts[item.key]" :options="accountOptions"/></label></div><b-form-checkbox v-model="settings.fourEyes">Revisión por otro usuario</b-form-checkbox><b-form-checkbox v-model="settings.taxReviewed">Configuración tributaria revisada por el contador</b-form-checkbox><b-button v-if="can('manage')" @click="write('configure',{version:company.Version,settings})">Guardar configuración</b-button></article></div></section>
 <section v-if="tab==='audit'" class="co-section"><h2>Auditoría contable</h2><b-table small responsive :items="audit" :fields="auditFields"><template slot="Action" slot-scope="r">{{ auditLabel(r.item.Action) }}</template><template slot="Entity" slot-scope="r">{{ auditLabel(r.item.Entity) }}</template><template slot="EntityId" slot-scope="r">{{ ['catalog','batch'].includes(r.item.EntityId)?auditLabel(r.item.EntityId):r.item.EntityId }}</template><template slot="Data" slot-scope="r"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ auditDetails(r.item.Data) }}</span></template></b-table><p>Se conservan creación, revisión, aprobación, contabilización, reverso, importaciones, cierres y exportaciones. No hay acción para borrar la auditoría.</p></section>
 </template>
 <b-modal v-model="entryOpen" title="Detalle del asiento" size="xl" hide-footer><template v-if="selected"><div class="co-toolbar"><strong>#{{ selected.Id }} · {{ selected.EntryDate }} · {{ statusLabel(selected.Status) }}</strong><b-badge>Versión {{ selected.Version }}</b-badge></div><p>{{ selected.Memo }} · {{ selected.Document }} · {{ selected.Currency }} / TC {{ selected.ExchangeRate }}</p><b-table small responsive :items="selected.lines" :fields="['Account','AccountName','Debit','Credit','PartyType','PartyId','CashFlow']"><template slot="Debit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Debit) }}</template><template slot="Credit" slot-scope="r">{{ money(r.item.Credit) }}</template></b-table><div class="co-toolbar"><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='draft'&&selected.SourceType==='manual'&&can('draft')" @click="editDraft">Editar borrador</b-button><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='draft'&&can('review')" @click="entryAction('review')">Marcar revisado</b-button><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='reviewed'&&can('approve')" @click="entryAction('approve')">Aprobar</b-button><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='approved'&&can('post')" variant="success" @click="entryAction('post')">Contabilizar</b-button><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='draft'&&can('draft')" variant="outline-danger" @click="entryAction('discard')">Descartar borrador</b-button><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='posted'&&selected.tax&&selected.tax.State==='active'&&can('approve')" variant="outline-warning" @click="voidTax">Registrar anulaci?n tributaria sustentada</b-button><b-button v-if="selected.Status==='posted'&&can('reverse')&&!selected.ReversalOf" variant="outline-danger" @click="reverseEntry">Crear reverso</b-button></div></template></b-modal>
 <b-modal v-model="formOpen" :title="modalTitle" size="xl" hide-footer @hidden="modal=''">
  <form @submit.prevent="submitForm">
  <template v-if="modal==='company'"><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Razón social<b-form-input v-model="companyForm.name" required/></label><label>RUC<b-form-input v-model="companyForm.ruc" required maxlength="11"/></label><label>Régimen<b-form-select v-model="companyForm.regime" :options="regimes"/></label><label>Obligación de registros<b-form-select v-model="companyForm.obligation" :options="[{value:'none',text:'Por definir / Sin obligación'},{value:'sire',text:'SIRE'},{value:'ple',text:'PLE'}]"/></label></div></template>
  <template v-if="modal==='account'"><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Código<b-form-input v-model="account.code" required/></label><label>Nombre<b-form-input v-model="account.name" required/></label><label>Cuenta superior (código)<b-form-input v-model="account.parent" placeholder="Vacío si es una cuenta principal"/></label><label>Naturaleza<b-form-select v-model="account.nature" :options="natureOptions"/></label><label>Clasificación<b-form-select v-model="account.class" :options="classOptions"/></label><label>Rubro en los reportes<b-form-select v-model="account.group" :options="groupOptions" required/></label><b-form-checkbox v-model="account.postable">Recibe movimientos</b-form-checkbox><b-form-checkbox v-model="account.active">Activa</b-form-checkbox></div></template>
  <template v-if="modal==='draft'"><b-form-checkbox v-if="!draft.id" v-model="draft.opening">Asiento de apertura inicial (no vuelve a cargar saldos que ya existen)</b-form-checkbox><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Fecha<b-form-input type="date" v-model="draft.date" :disabled="!!draft.id" required/></label><label>Sucursal<b-form-select v-model="draft.branchId" :options="branchOptions" :disabled="!!draft.id"/></label><label>Moneda<b-form-select v-model="draft.currency" :options="['PEN','USD','EUR']" :disabled="!!draft.id"/></label><label>Tipo de cambio<b-form-input v-model="draft.rate" :disabled="!!draft.id" required/></label><label>Documento<b-form-input v-model="draft.document" :disabled="!!draft.id"/></label><label>Glosa<b-form-input v-model="draft.memo" required maxlength="500"/></label></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>Cuenta</th><th>Debe</th><th>Haber</th><th>Flujo</th><th>Tercero tipo / ID</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(line,i) in draft.lines" :key="i"><td><b-form-select v-model="line.account" :options="accountOptions"/></td><td><b-form-input v-model="line.debit" inputmode="decimal"/></td><td><b-form-input v-model="line.credit" inputmode="decimal"/></td><td><b-form-select v-model="line.cashFlow" :options="flows"/></td><td><b-form-input v-model="line.partyType" placeholder="customer / supplier"/><b-form-input v-model="line.partyId" placeholder="ID del tercero"/></td><td><b-button size="sm" @click="draft.lines.splice(i,1)">Quitar</b-button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><b-button type="button" @click="draft.lines.push({account:'',debit:'0',credit:'0',cashFlow:''})">Agregar línea</b-button><details><summary>Datos electr?nicos PLE (cuando corresponda)</summary><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Tipo identidad emisor<b-form-input v-model="draft.electronic.issuerType"/></label><label>Documento emisor<b-form-input v-model="draft.electronic.issuerDoc"/></label><label>Tipo comprobante<b-form-input v-model="draft.electronic.docType"/></label><label>Serie<b-form-input v-model="draft.electronic.series"/></label><label>N?mero / referencia interna<b-form-input v-model="draft.electronic.number"/></label><label>Referencia registro PLE<b-form-input v-model="draft.electronic.reference"/></label></div></details><p>Debe y haber se validan en moneda original y funcional. Se guarda como borrador.</p></template>
  <template v-if="modal==='template'"><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Operación<b-form-select v-model="operation.kind" :options="operationKinds"/></label><label>Fecha<b-form-input type="date" v-model="operation.date" required/></label><label>Importe<b-form-input v-model="operation.amount" required/></label><label>Identificador único<b-form-input v-model="operation.sourceId" required/></label><label>Glosa<b-form-input v-model="operation.memo" required/></label><label>Documento<b-form-input v-model="operation.document"/></label><label>Flujo<b-form-select v-model="operation.cashFlow" :options="flows"/></label><label>Tercero tipo<b-form-input v-model="operation.partyType"/></label><label>Tercero ID<b-form-input v-model="operation.partyId"/></label></div></template>
  <template v-if="modal==='bank'"><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Nombre<b-form-input v-model="bank.name" required/></label><label>Número / identificador<b-form-input v-model="bank.number" required/></label><label>Moneda<b-form-select v-model="bank.currency" :options="['PEN','USD','EUR']"/></label><label>ID cuenta ERP (para sincronizar caja)<b-form-input type="number" v-model.number="bank.legacyId"/></label><label>Cuenta PCGE bancaria<b-form-select v-model="bank.account" :options="accountOptions" required/></label></div></template>
  <template v-if="modal==='asset'"><div class="co-form-grid"><label>Activo<b-form-input v-model="asset.name" required/></label><label>Inicio de depreciación<b-form-input type="date" v-model="asset.startDate" required/></label><label>Costo<b-form-input v-model="asset.cost" required/></label><label>Residual<b-form-input v-model="asset.residual" required/></label><label>Vida útil en meses<b-form-input type="number" min="1" v-model.number="asset.lifeMonths"/></label><label>Cuenta de gasto<b-form-select v-model="asset.expenseAccount" :options="accountOptions"/></label><label>Cuenta de depreciación acumulada<b-form-select v-model="asset.accumulatedAccount" :options="accountOptions"/></label></div></template>
